@page "/frames"

<PageTitle>Frames - Brinell Blazor Sample</PageTitle>

@* A same-origin iframe for FrameScope (.my/html/sample-app.md item 7). The outer page has a
   status of its own with the same test id as the frame's, so a test proves which document a
   control was found in. *@
<h1 data-testid="frames-title">Frames</h1>

<p data-testid="inner-status">Outer page status</p>

<iframe data-testid="inner-frame" src="frames/inner.html" title="Inner frame" style="width: 100%; height: 200px;"></iframe>
